 "order": 4,
 "title": {
  "zh": "例 4：Fe XV n = 3 能级，芯-价关联与 E1、M2 跃迁",
  "en": "Example 4: Fe XV n = 3 levels, core-valence correlation, E1 and M2 transitions"
 },
 "summary": {
  "zh": "偶宇称 3s²、3p²、3s3d 和奇宇称 3s3p、3p3d：先做多参考 Dirac-Fock，再加入 2p 芯与价电子的关联到 n = 4 做 MCDHF 和 CI，变换到 LSJ 耦合，计算 E1 和 M2 跃迁并生成跃迁表、寿命表和含组成的能级表 (lscomp.pl，需要 perl)。单进程运行的结果与手册相同；在“设置”中用多个 MPI 进程时，所有步骤都改用 MPI 版本，能量会有 10⁻⁷ Hartree 量级的差别。",
  "en": "Even 3s², 3p², 3s3d and odd 3s3p, 3p3d: multireference Dirac-Fock, then core-valence correlation with the 2p core to n = 4 (MCDHF and CI), transformation to LSJ coupling, E1 and M2 transitions, transition and lifetime tables, and an energy table with compositions (lscomp.pl, needs perl). A serial run reproduces the manual's results; with several MPI processes in the Settings every step uses the MPI version and the energies differ at the 10⁻⁷ Hartree level."
 },
 "runtime": {
  "zh": "约 3 分钟",
  "en": "about 3 minutes"
 },
